        "slug": "b1-summarizing-relaying-relay-shifts",
        "title": "Basic time and pronoun shifts",
        "rule_summary": "When reporting later, words such as today/tomorrow and I/we may need to change to keep meaning clear.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "وقتی بعداً حرف کسی رو منتقل می‌کنیم، کلماتی مثل today/tomorrow و ضمیرها ممکنه برای حفظ معنی تغییر کنند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "'I'll call tomorrow.' → She said she'd call the next day.",
            "fa": "گفت روز بعد تماس می‌گیره."
          },
          {
            "en": "'We need this today.' → They said they needed it that day.",
            "fa": "گفتند همان روز لازم دارند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b1_summarizing_relaying_workshop",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-summarizing-relaying-01",
        "title": "Relaying a workshop change",
        "setting": "office",
        "cefr": "B1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Lina",
          "Ben"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Lina",
            "text": "I missed the announcement. What's happening with tomorrow's workshop?",
            "translation_fa": "اعلان رو ندیدم. کارگاه فردا چی شد؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Ben",
            "text": "It's moved online. The start time hasn't changed.",
            "translation_fa": "آنلاین شده. ساعت شروع عوض نشده."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Lina",
            "text": "Do we already have the new link?",
            "translation_fa": "لینک جدید رو داریم؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Ben",
            "text": "Not yet. They said they'd send it this afternoon.",
            "translation_fa": "هنوز نه. گفتند بعدازظهر می‌فرستن."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b1_summarizing_relaying_deadline",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-summarizing-relaying-02",
        "title": "Passing on a deadline change",
        "setting": "phone call",
        "cefr": "B1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Amir",
          "Ella"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "Could you tell Maya the client changed the deadline to Wednesday?",
            "translation_fa": "می‌شه به مایا بگی مشتری مهلت رو به چهارشنبه عوض کرد؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Sure. Anything else?",
            "translation_fa": "حتماً. چیز دیگه‌ای؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "Yes. They still want the draft by Monday for an early review.",
            "translation_fa": "آره. هنوز پیش‌نویس رو برای بررسی اولیه تا دوشنبه می‌خوان."
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Got it. I'll make sure she knows both dates.",
            "translation_fa": "فهمیدم. مطمئن می‌شم هر دو تاریخ رو می‌دونه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
